window.products.push({"id":1115046,"name":"Lawei 30 Pack 3.5 Inch Clear Plastic Fillable Ornament Balls, Heart Shape Ornament Discs Ball, Hanging Ornaments Ball with Silver Rope for DIY Craft, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pNit8I2ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Value Pack: You will receive 30pcs clear plastic ornaments fillable ball, each heart shape decorative ball is packed separately. Size: each ball has a diameter of 90mm (3.5 inches), perfcet for Christmas, Halloween, birthday, wedding, and other special occasions, or use it as a home decor piece. Durable and Premium Material: Lawei fillable balls ornaments are made of high-quality PP plastic and aluminum material, with lightweight and not easy to deform, environmentally friendly and durable. The clear and shiny appearance makes it the best christmas decoration. Reusable Hanging Plastic Balls: Our heart christmas ornaments have a removable silver metal cover and top hook, which can be filled with baubles and hung for easy access. You just need to unscrew the metal cover on the top of the transparent decorative christmas balls and change the different fillings to be reused in different events. DIY Craft Ornaments Balls: Decorate with paint, stickers, ribbon, fabric, glitter, confetti, charms, markers and other craft items. Painting on the outside of clear plastic ornaments for crafts, make your unique ornaments for a fun and quick neighbor gift, teacher gift, or gift for other family and friends. Wide Application: The transparent ornaments ball can be used in different holiday party themes, you only need to change different fillers. Clear ornament bulbs are suitable for christmas tree decoration, shopping mall window display, gift candy packaging, holiday party decorations. And suitable for personalized wedding, engagements, anniversaries, Valentine, Birthday Party Decorations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pNit8I2ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lawei","source_asin":"B0BDFF863M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1115046","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDFF863M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDFF863M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1115047,"name":"College Covers Ohio State Buckeyes Printed Curtain Valance - 84\" x 15\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xAUH59MfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These Ohio State Buckeyes curtain valances are made and licensed by College Covers. This curtain valance includes a printed 84” X 15” valance, perfect for finishing off any room decor. These match perfectly to our 63\" or 84\" curtain panels, also available but not included. Our curtain valance has a 2” rod pocket and a 2” header complete with offically licensed logos and colors. Made with 100% cotton sateen, 200 thread count, then printed for long lasting color and decoration. Machine washable in cold water, tumble dry on low heat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xAUH59MfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"College Covers","source_asin":"B0015B9LCG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1115047","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0015B9LCG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0015B9LCG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1115048,"name":"Concord Granite Nonstick 7 Quart Stock Pot Cookware Set (Induction Compatible) (Grey)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XiNNjxxZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Concord's 7 Quart premium nonstick coated stock pot. Granite coating is 2-3x tougher than traditional nonstick coatings on the market. Granite coating is made without PFAS, PFOA, and Cadmium. Beautiful Granite coating looks modern and sleek on any kitchen stovetop. Wide rim design makes for easy pouring. Size: 9.5\" Wide x 7\" Height. Induction Compatible","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XiNNjxxZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Concord Cookware","source_asin":"B09C2TMDRW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1115048","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C2TMDRW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C2TMDRW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1115049,"name":"Grey Bathroom Toilet Seat Warmer Cover Washable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Dxsnls9cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Can't afford the expensive electric toilet seat warmer? This is your solution! A specially woven fabric that is soft, warm and cozy to the touch. This material is stain resistant. Once you put it in water and add soap, there is not much scrubbing to do. It is made to fit perfectly on your round or elongated standard toilet seat. More importantly, it accomplishes the goal of making your trip to the bathroom more pleasant. WASHABLE!!! • Warm Seat Cover will shield your body from cold related injuries • Cover provides warm shelter from your cold toilet seat • Prolonged exposure to cold shocks, cold chills may lead to injuries—So, prevent the skin sensation, aches and discomfort Do you dread sitting on your toilet seat especially in the winter months? Do you experience discomfort or skin soreness around your bottom and thighs during the cold winter months due to long exposure to your cold toilet seat? Do you sometimes have to pad your toilet seat to summon the courage to sit? Do you sometimes wince before you sit on your toilet seat knowing the brrrrr…will be your next reaction? Do you sometimes hold it as long as possible so you won’t have to sit on your toilet seat especially in the winter months? No more icy toilet seats; No more cold shocks; No More brrrr…; No more squatting; No more wincing; No more chills; No more cold toilet seat – not in winter, not in summer, NOT The toilet seat warmer can be hand or machine washed (hand wash highly recommended). Install in 60 seconds or less! You will appreciate the difference when you remove your toilet seat cover to wash and have to seat back on your cold toilet seat. ***Please Note*** This will NOT fit padded, foamed, cushioned, Toto or other fancy toilet seat since that configuration already takes up so much surface area. However, this will fit up to 20 inches of both round and elongated regular standard toilet seats.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Dxsnls9cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LifeLong Needs","source_asin":"B00O8BLPXS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1115049","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00O8BLPXS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00O8BLPXS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
