window.products.push({"id":1115228,"name":"Set of 4 Collapsible Food Storage Containers With Lids 1200ml/800ml/500ml/350ml - Silicone Leak-Proof Airtight Microwave & Dishwasher-Safe Stacking Le","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610m2j5YFNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💯COLLAPSIBLE, SPACE-SAVING DESIGN: Cramped pantries and overflowing cabinets have nothing on our family of collapsible storage containers! Save space AND delicious leftovers with four leak-proof food containers that won’t clutter your kitchen. With a unique stacking design, they’re perfect for camping trips or stowing away in vacation luggage, too! 🍝4 GREAT SIZES FOR VERSATILE STORAGE: From solo spaghetti meals to large helpings of extra mac n’ cheese, your yummy leftovers will never go to waste. Keep small amounts of soup or large portions of family meals in four different storage sizes that hold whatever your belly couldn’t. Like to plan ahead? Weekly meal prep couldn’t be easier! 🍴INCLUDES 6 HANDY SPORKS: Is it a spoon? A fork? A knife? It’s the best of ALL worlds! Dig into your favorite pasta dish, sip steamy clam chowder or slice through soft fruit with this 3-in-1 utensil! We’ve included six of ‘em, so there’s plenty to pack with the kids’ lunches or bring along on a family picnic without hauling loads of silverware! 🔝100% AIRTIGHT, LEAK-PROOF SNAP LIDS: Keep your mouth-watering lasagna as cheesy as the moment you cooked it with airtight lids that lock in freshness and flavor. Plus, store wet foods like hardy stews or homemade hot sauce with rock-solid snaps that make that satisfying “click” every time you close them. Leftovers never tasted so fresh! ✔️FLEXIBLE, SHATTER-PROOF SILICONE: No need to break out the broom for shattered tupperware. Flexible silicone construction ensures that even a gasp-inducing bowl drop won’t end in frustrating cleanup. Always looking out for your family’s health? Unlike plastic, silicone won’t leech harmful chemicals into your meal and is SO much better for the environment!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610m2j5YFNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALLER HOME&KITCHEN","source_asin":"B08FSQ835B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1115228","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FSQ835B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FSQ835B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
