window.products.push({"id":1115247,"name":"Tyler Diva Dryer Sachets, 4 Glamorous Reusable Dryer Sachets Each Pack, 2 Pack, Home, or Personal Sachet, Bundle with a Lumintrail Degreaser Pen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nXlvExoEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Tyler glamorous sachets are the perfect addition to your Tyler glamour wash. The glamorous sachets will help you add the luxurious Tyler scents to your clean laundry. These sachets may be reused to add fragrance and soften up to 8 loads of laundry. The Tyler sachets may also be used to fragrance your home while vacuuming. Simply place the sachet in the vacuum cleaner bag; the sachet will fragrance your home as you clean. The glamorous sachets may also be used to freshen up your personal items, such as, gym bags, Lingerie drawers, trash pails, and many more. The box includes 4 reusable glamorous dryer sachets or enough for up to 8 loads of laundry per sachet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nXlvExoEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lumintrail","source_asin":"B099NY9KYW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1115247","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099NY9KYW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099NY9KYW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1115248,"name":"New Traditions Simplify Your Holiday 3-Pack 20 inch Faux Fur Stocking with Folded Cuff & Pom-Poms (Gray/Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wkCmLwkJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The New Traditions Faux Fur Stockings come in a set of three Christmas stockings designed to bring a rustic coziness to your holiday decorations. Each measuring 20” long, these full-sized stockings are large enough to accommodate an abundance of stocking stuffers and gifts. The stockings are made from a shimmery gray faux fur and feature a wide, folded over cuff of the same material. Two large faux fur pom-poms dangle from the top of the cuff. Fully lined, these holiday stockings include a matching gray fabric loop so they can be hung by the fireplace mantle with your other family Christmas stockings. These versatile holiday stockings can equally complement both sophisticated décor as well as rustic holiday decorations. When each member of the family has one of these soft and cozy faux fur Christmas stockings, their Christmas morning surprises will seem even more special. A festive addition to any home’s Christmas decorations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wkCmLwkJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"New Traditions Simplify Your Holiday","source_asin":"B087N5NWVT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1115248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087N5NWVT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087N5NWVT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1115249,"name":"Neoflam Retro 10-Inch Cast Aluminum Deep Frying Pan with Soft-Touch Handle and Ecolon Non-Stick Coating","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E-CKYhROL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Retro, winner of the 2014 Red Dot Design Award, is like its namesake suggests: a throwback to a classic and elegant style from the past. Retro is a fresh and trendy take on a traditional design. The philosophy of Retro is to bring a timeless look to a modern audience, evoking warm memories from a not too distant era. Whether you are cooking for yourself or your friends and family, Retro's pastel-like colors create an inviting ambiance. Equipped with a soft touch handle, Retro's unique yet familiar look will surely complement any kitchen. Retro's cast aluminum design provides multiple benefits to the user. Retro's thick wall gauge provides durability and a quality feel. Known for its exceptional durability and high heat conductivity, cast aluminum is rising in popularity as a safe and affordable alternative to stainless steel. At just 1/3 the weight of cast iron, cast aluminum's even heat distribution properties allow for fast cooking and reduced energy consumption. Furthermore, the cast aluminum body and lid work in conjunction to create a convection effect, producing currents of hot air for more efficient cooking. Made in Korea. What is Ecolon™ coating? Ecolon™ by Neoflam is a professional grade non-stick, ceramic coating. Derived from the earth's minerals, Ecolon™ is PFOA free. Ecolon™ is applied to both the interior and exterior of the product, sustaining the product's durability while also facilitating convenience in cleaning. About Neoflam Neoflam is dedicated to bringing forth innovative kitchenware and household products that are healthy. Each product is engineered to have both exceptional design and performance; Neoflam's leadership in product design has been recognized by the following prestigious design awards: iF (2012), Red Dot (2012,2013,2014), and Design Plus (2014).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E-CKYhROL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Neoflam","source_asin":"B017AUWUUU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1115249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017AUWUUU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017AUWUUU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
