window.products.push({"id":1115290,"name":"Bradex Crepes Electric Maker Griddle Non-stick Coating For Pancakes Blintzes Eggs & More 7.5inch with Container for the Dough (tk0237)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GuhEJsGKL._AC_SL1399_.jpg","description":"Never before has making crepes been such a simple and quick process. Just dip the surface of the griddle into the dough container to bake the ideal crepes. Who needs a frying pan when you have this convenient Electric Crepe Griddle? No more tragically torn crepes. The griddle has a non-stick coating, and a surface that evenly distributes heat throughout the dough of your crepes. For your safety and comfort, neither the handle nor the bottom of the griddle are heated. Another advantage of this device is that it does not require a large amount of oil. The electric griddle is also very simple to clean. The griddle comes with a dough container that is the perfect fit to allow the griddle to dip into it completely and make large, even crepes. The device has a 900 W power with a frequency of 50-60 Hz, and a power supply of 220-240 V. The power cord has a length of 57 cm, and the heating element is 19 cm. It reaches a maximum temperature of 210°C.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GuhEJsGKL._AC_SL1399_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bradex","source_asin":"B06XFTZT44","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1115290","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XFTZT44","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XFTZT44","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1115291,"name":"VacLife Handheld Vacuum, Hand Vacuum Cleaner Cordless w/Strong Suction, Portable & Rechargeable Vacuum Cleaner for Car, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gxmdc2EoL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"We will refund your money or replace the hand vacuum you buy without bothering you to return the unit if you encounter any problems with VacLife Handheld Vacuum Cleaner; Contact Us! Contact Us! Contact Us! We all need to clean up our place, cause we hope to live in a clean environment. For smaller messes, tidying them up by hauling out an upright or canister vacuum seems like a bad idea. For this kind of situation, a small vacuum cleaner with cordless could provide quick cleaning without a lot of heavy lifting.  VacLife handheld cordless vacuum cleaner is powered by cyclone vacuum technology, and a powerful engine ensures vacuum cleaner small but could have strong power. Strong suction makes this small handheld vacuum easily and perfectly tidy up every single corner of the vehicle and house. It definitely will become your little helper to catch those dust or pets’ hair that in gaps on the sofa.  Besides, VacLife handheld vacuum cordless is not only a nice portable vacuum cleaner for home but also a reliable handheld car vacuum. Attached special brushes could make this wireless vacuum efficiently tidy up the dirt on vehicle carpets and dust in the gaps of seats.  One built-in 2500mAh Li-ion battery in vacuum cleaner in cordless ensures this rechargeable vacuum could keep working for 25 - 30mins with charging just 3-4 hrs. Moreover, this small vacuum cleaner in handheld installs full charging and low battery warning system, which could make you schdule your cleaning time easier!  When we clean up some dirty places, lots of dirt, hairs, and dust particles would jam the filter of vacuum, and lead to decreasing of suction. VacLife portable vacuum in cordless equipped with dismountable and washable nylon filter, which not only could mostly block the dirt to ease off the decreasing of suction, but also make filter cleaning process become easier at the same time.  Got a dark corner need to clean up? VacLife got you! 2 bright LED lights are settled on two sides of vacuum cleaner near the handheld area, and make you could clearly see every dirt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gxmdc2EoL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VacLife","source_asin":"B0BR1BP3FP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1115291","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR1BP3FP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR1BP3FP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
