window.products.push({"id":1115319,"name":"Audecook Electric Hot Pot 2L, Non-Stick Ceramic Glaze Frying Pan 8\", Multifunction Electric Skillet Pan for Steak, Egg, Ramen, Oatmeal, Soup with Powe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FAFv4hzwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multifunctional Electric Hot Pot - Audecook electric hot pot with dual power supply at the end (350W and 800W), allowing you to easily control the temperature to satisfy different cooking needs: 350W power for making omelettes, ramen, pancake; 800W power for steaming salmon, frenching fries, cooking hot pot, sautéing vegetables and steaks. Cook and Sauté without stove anytime! 2L Large Capacity Electric Hot Pot - Audecook 8\" Electric Frying Pan with High Rim 2.1\" is designed for professional multi-cooking purposes, ensuring you have ample space to cook for sauté, boil and fry. Elegant matte exterior design paired with a sophisticated wood-effect plastic handle, this portable cooker is the perfect gift for cooking lovers. Healthy Non-Stick Coating - The interior of Audecook electric hot pot is made of 5h hardness aluminum alloy, durable and easy to clean, even no pressure with wire brush. The surface has a food-grade ceramic glaze non-stick coating, PFOA free. It allows food flows smoothly on the frying pan surface without sticking. Cook healthier food with less oil! Quick & Even Heating - Unique 360° annular heating base of Audecook electric hot pot allows your food to heat up more quickly and evenly on this non-stick surface. In addition, the electric frying pan has improved overheating protection. Auto power off will be triggered once the pan exceeds 180°C, effectively protect the pot from overheating. Portable and Guaranteed - Audecook Mini cooker is perfect for RV car, travel, dorms, apartments, hotels and camping. The compact size and light weight make it very convenient to carry anywhere. In addition, Audecook Electric Hot Pot comes with lifetime support and a 90-day quality warranty; if you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FAFv4hzwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Audecook","source_asin":"B0C3HD9T4R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1115319","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3HD9T4R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3HD9T4R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
