window.products.push({"id":1115344,"name":"Welhome Landon Modern Reversible Oversize Quilt Full/Queen Size - Heather Navy - 96\" x 96\" - Soft Textured - Lightweight - Cotton Polyester Quilt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1ecyJEuE+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUALITY DESIGN in a collection of neutral colors for easy coordination no matter the season or style of décor. Relax and cover up with chambray tonal shades of light grey, dark gray or navy blue. Features an easy, modest everyday stripe stitching detail that creates a smooth texture for an effortlessly chic yet minimal detail. Pair or gift with the Landon Duvet Set and 220TC Solid CVC Sheet Set by Welspun Basics to complete or compliment the look. Each sold separately. SLEEP WELL with a soft 100% cotton quilt. Relax and keep cozy with a quilt featuring gorgeous stitching details that are then blended with a percale weave for a soft on skin hand feel. You'll love your space and bed even more. A lightweight 144 thread-count is perfect for a comfortable layering warmth. Available in two sizes. Full/Queen Includes: 1 quilt (96in x 96in). King/Cal-King Includes: 1 quilt (114in x 96in). MUST HAVE FEATURES for inviting comfort and beauty in your home. Crafted with a classic percale weave, this basic crisscross pattern provides a crisp, cool texture that is soft to the touch and tightly woven for durability. Use as a stand-alone coverlet piece, guest quilt bedding set or any bed needing an extra thin layer. Easy to pair back or makeup with comforters, blankets, throws and decorative pillows. Great gift idea for housewarming gifts or college dorm. Refresh your mattress today. QUALITY MATERIAL AND EASY CARE, machine washable, soft and breathable, lightweight cotton. Machine wash cold, delicate cycle with like colors. Use large capacity washer and dryer. Do not bleach, tumble dry low. Do not iron or dry clean. Styled with classic bound edges and mitered corners that deliver a polished tailored look. Pillow shams include center overlap closure to secure pillow fill. Quilt filled with a lightweight 150 GSM, 100% Polyester for breathability and warmth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1ecyJEuE+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Welhome","source_asin":"B07SS3SDGY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1115344","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SS3SDGY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SS3SDGY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
