window.products.push({"id":1115439,"name":"Daverose Calming Weighted Blanket for Adults 20lbs 58\"X80\" 180-220lbs Adults Full Size | 100% Natural Cotton | Children Comfort Sensory Heavy Blanket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iZkb2FrkL._AC_SL1213_.jpg","description":"Cotton Imported 1.SMALLER! WHY? - Why smaller is better? Daverose 3.0 weighted blanket sews the pockets into 4\"x4\" sizes, much smaller than ordinary 6\"x6\" sizes. Multiple advantages:①Weights of glass beads are distributed more evenly. ②Smaller chances for glass beads leaking out. ③More weight points hug your body in nights. ④Less noise and quieter when use. Smaller, is better! 2.NEW GENERATION INTEGRATION - Daverose cares what you care, so all weighted blankets are made of eco-friendly glass beads and breathable natural organic cotton fabrics. We adapt unique 7-layer quilting system, which adds two layers more than others, weakening graininess and locking warmth. 58\"x80\" 20lbs is suitable for individuals weighing about 180-220lbs and QUEEN BED. 3.SAFE!SAFE!SAFE! - Daverose is a professional weighted blanket design and production factory, and safety lies first of all in our business concept. Our every blanket passed the OEKO-TEX STANDARD 100 CERTIFICATE(Textile authority certification), 100% safe for human use. 4.BEST AFTER-SALE 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - No worries about the cleaning, use machine wash on a gentle cycle for no more than twice one year, to extend its service life, spot clean is more labor-saving. We offer a best after-sale service with 5-YEAR FREE WARRANTY(shipping label not included). Kindly email us for anything you think about our weighted blanket. 5. WE DO CARE YOU - We love you as our family, we want you to use the blanket safely by not covering your face or head. Pregnant women is not recommended. Welcome for any suggestions about our weighted blanket. We want to make your nights better and make our blankets better, so the world will be better. It is a dream and we will reach it with you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iZkb2FrkL._AC_SL1213_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Daverose","source_asin":"B07XSCQF9R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1115439","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XSCQF9R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XSCQF9R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
