window.products.push({"id":1115682,"name":"CEROELDA Small Trash Can with Lid-5L/1.3 Gal Stainless Steel Round Step Pedal Garbage Can -Trash Bin-Metal Wastebasket w/for Kitchen Bathroom Bedroom ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hgmx9VGhL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"♻️Silent Soft Close & Stay Open Lid: Touchless trash can, the lid will automatically close after you press the pedal to open the lid, very quiet, no loud noise, don’t worry about disturbing the rest of your family. Push the lid up by hand to hold the lid at 90° to keep it open. ♻️Retro Design: This metal trash can with lid and handle is the perfect vintage garbage can specially designed with striped body, handle and matte finish. Looks sophisticated and retro whether used in bathrooms, bedrooms, offices, toilets, powder rooms, farmhouses, apartments, dorms, etc. ♻️High-Quality Material: The body of this trash can is forged from Stainless Steel, thick and durable, and anti-fingerprint; The inner barrel is made of pp material, and the inner barrel is equipped with garbage bag fixing hole to hide the extra trash bag, which makes it more beautiful and elegant. ♻️Removable Inner Bucket: The step trash can has a durable plastic liner bucket that can be easily lifted out for easy dumping of trash and rinsing quickly when needed. There is a carry handle on the back of the round trash can to move it easier. ♻️Odor-Free: This bathroom trash can has a lid and double-layer design, odor can't escape. It can be easily opened and closed by simply the pedal of the trash can. Creates a perfect seal with no trash bags showing for a clean look. ♻️Excellent Customer Service: If you received a small trash can that is dented, broken or the wrong color, please feel free to contact us and we will answer within 24 hours, your satisfaction is the encouragement of us to chase high-quality products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hgmx9VGhL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CEROELDA","source_asin":"B0BJPD1BWS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1115682","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJPD1BWS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJPD1BWS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
