window.products.push({"id":1115769,"name":"Rhythm Clocks \"Joyful Crystal Bells\" Musical Motion Mantel Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":138.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qzlSjBAhL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Joyful Crystal Bells Mantel Clock by Rhythm Clocks features 12 melodies including 6 Christian Hymns! The Joyful Crystal Bells plays 2 groups of six songs each. Just flip a switch on the side of the clock to make your selection of which group you wish to hear. HYMNS Amazing Grace In the Garden Ave maria How Great Thou Art Jesus Loves Me What A Friend We Have In Jesus CHRISTMAS SONGS The First Noel Jingle Bells Silent Night Deck the Halls Joy to the World We Wish You a Merry Christmas Dimensions are 9.8\" H x 7.9\"W Rhythm Clocks' Joyful Crystal Bells Mantel Clock also features a demonstration button, auto night shut off, volume control, and a one year limited warranty from Rhythm Clock. Not sure? click here to visit Help me choose a Rhythm or Seiko Musical Clock.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qzlSjBAhL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rhythm USA","source_asin":"B005U70N8M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1115769","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005U70N8M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005U70N8M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1115770,"name":"Dremisland Black Triple Moon Goddess Macrame Wall Hanging Large Dream Catcher Boho Wiccan Moon Phases Handmade Bohemian Hippie Woven Pagan Wall Decor ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.68,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81u+DoDJFSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Handmade Large Dream Catcher】Our dream catcher adopts a large size design, which is much larger than the general dream catcher.Each of the 3 moon phases are individually formed and hand wrapped with coordinated cotton yarn. Then attached together forming the triple moon symbol. Unique cotton yarn lace design， giving a minimalist elegant feel, create a relax feel in the room. 【Unique Design】The dream catcher is made of dense complex crochet knotting in center and complemented by lighter and softer side weave details.Match with gorgeous mixture of ribbons, lace, yarns that give a sense of rustic, magic and pureness. This handmade Native American design dream catcher will fit great for outdoor decor, wedding decor, engagement party, ceremony backdrop, baby shower and rustic interior concepts. 【Best Blessing gift】The hippie triple moon is a goddess symbol that represents the Maiden, Mother, and Crone as the waxing, full ,and waning moon. It is also associated with feminine energy, mystery and psychic abilities. The moon net are believed to protect us from all the bad dreams. It is a meaningful gift to newborns and young children as it is believed that they bless new parent, child or truly anyone. 【Beautiful Art Ornament】This triple moon goddess macrame wall hanging commands attention in any space, beautifully bold and full of bohemian style.Beautiful wall art creates a sense of harmony and comfort for your room. It is great for a bedroom, dorm room, living area, baby nursery, spiritual room,workspace or anywhere where you'd like to bring some texture and interest to your walls. 【Perfect Home Decor】Do you want better vibes in your room? Just imagine your room’s wall elegantly draped with this unique dream catcher. Or, maybe its your child’s room, and she is sleeping peacefully under the dream catcher. Either way, this dream catcher will bring you the vibes that you’re searching for.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81u+DoDJFSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dremisland","source_asin":"B0BG42JCJB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1115770","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG42JCJB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG42JCJB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
