window.products.push({"id":1115833,"name":"Floating Shelves Set of 3, 24 Inches Solid Wood Wall Mounted Shelves for Wall Storage, Metal Shelf Bracket and Reliable Structure (Wooden, 24 Inches)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jlO8h2Q0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Must for Your Home: Whether you’re looking to create more storage space in your living room or bedroom, or you simply want to add a beautiful farmhouse vibe to your home decor, the Inforth hanging shelves are the perfect choice! Heavy Duty Craftsmanship: This book shelf for wall is crafted with premium quality, highly durable materials, a combination of solid paulownia wood bases, heavy duty rustproof metal shelf bracket and smooth finishes, designed to withstand the test of time. Superb Farmhouse Design: Featuring a gorgeous natural brown color, combined with the matte black bracket coating, these floating shelves wood will nicely compliment any room decor, ideal for bedroom, living room, kitchen, bathroom, kids’ room and office! Easy DIY Installation: Unlike similar products on the market, the Inforth storage shelf comes with everything you need for a smooth and user-friendly installation. You’ll receive mounting tools and accessories, hardware and instructions! Versatile Uses: These floating shelves for bedroom have a total length of 24 inches and come in convenient sets of 3, providing 3 different installation modes depending on your needs. An excellent choice for storing and displaying books, artwork, pictures, succulents, memorabilia, clean towels, kitchen accessories, spices and more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jlO8h2Q0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Inforth","source_asin":"B0C6TBCNWV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1115833","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6TBCNWV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6TBCNWV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1115834,"name":"Authentic Gold Rush Show Paydirt from Parker's Mines - 2.5lb Bag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YlHIrPsZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Gold Rush's authentic paydirt takes authentic PayDirt from active and famous working mines and delivers it to the fans at home. We screen it down to remove large rocks and make it easier for you to pan, but we don’t clean it like many other pay dirts on the market. We leave all organic gold in the mix and also salt each bag so that you’re guaranteed to find gold in every singel bag. Please keep in mind that becuase we try to keep these mixes as AUTHENTIC as possible, there will be more organic matter, smaller rocks and sticks and panning this pay dirt is going to be more challenging. Results will vary and depend on your panning skills so be sure to pan over a bucket and pan it multiple times. Delivered right to your front door, this PayDirt is different because it comes directly from the mines featured on Discovery's show GOLD RUSH, Big Nugget Mine in Haines, Alaska or elsewhere. When you place an order, you will receive a bag of paydirt from one of the cuts listed above. All orders receive a bag of PayDirt (size depends on what you choose) guaranteed to contain gold, a custom cut card explaining the month’s cut and the story behind it, and a keepsake wooden box and glass vial to store your gold in. PayDirt will be from one of mines listed below: Big Nigget Mine Cuts Mackelravie Emmerson Trench Smith Creek Big Nugget Blend Parker’s Hole Parker's Yukon Claims Berm Cut Fantasyland Treasure Island Boundary Cut Creek Bed Cut Indian River North Indian River South Blend Cut","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YlHIrPsZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pay Dirt Gold Company","source_asin":"B071F576XY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1115834","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071F576XY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071F576XY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1115835,"name":"Ameriwood Home Lumina Fireplace TV Stand for TVs up to 70\" (Light Walnut)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816vH7vH-pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Step away from the ordinary and give your living room a modern makeover with the Ameriwood Home Lumina Fireplace TV Stand. Don’t let the simple look fool you, this stand comes with a 23” electric fireplace insert with all the bells and whistles. Ready to warm up a 400 square foot room with the touch of a button, you can relax knowing that timers will take care of the rest. If you want to simply enjoy the look of the flames without the heat use the included remote to switch off the heat option and pick your flame brightness. The fun doesn’t stop there though. On either side of the fireplace insert are three shelves, 2 glass, that hold your entertainment components like gaming systems, a DVD player, remotes and more. Both of the side shelves are illuminated with blue lights to coordinate with the glowing fireplace. This Fireplace TV Stand has a mix of woodgrain laminated particleboard, MDF and hollow core construction with metal feet and tempered glass shelving. Combined together this stand makes for a very sturdy addition to your room. The top can hold up to a 70” flat paneled TV with a maximum weight of 120 lbs. Two adults are recommended to assemble this Fireplace TV Stand. After assembly, the stand measures to be 24.875”H x 64.75”W x 18.875”D.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816vH7vH-pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ameriwood Home","source_asin":"B098K26SQ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1115835","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098K26SQ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098K26SQ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
