window.products.push({"id":1115840,"name":"ART-GIFTREE Guest Bathroom Decor, Toilet Tank Basket Please Seat Yourself Nice Butt Bathroom Decor Box, Toilet Paper Storage Tray with Sunflower Sign,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7196WTLkRJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Double-Sided Bathroom Decor Box: Each side of our toilet paper storage box features a different saying. On side reads, \"Please Seat Yourself\", the others reads, \"Nice Butt'' and features a flower sign. A little humor in the bathroom is a nice added touch. Rustic Farmhouse Decor Wooden Storage Box: Made of 100% pine wood, thick and durable, the real wood grain overlaid with interesting sayings makes for a cute eye-catcher in the bathroom. Two-in-One Decorative Floral Motif Sign and Storage Containers: These boxes can be used together so you have no need to think of additional combinations, or they can be used separately. The double-sided vintage floral design will be a adorable wherever you place it. Perfect Size for Back of Toilet: 13.77 x 6.29 x 2.95 inch. This box is made to fit on all standard toilet cisterns. This size allows you to store full rolls of toilet paper, as well as other accessories such as liquid hand soap, reed diffuser, air freshener, mason jar, and other essential items for your restroom. Housewarming Gift Idea: Whether you are moving into a new home or looking for a gift for someone else, make an accent statement with this bathroom decor box from ART-GIFTREE.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7196WTLkRJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ART-GIFTREE","source_asin":"B09ZNXMZ2Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1115840","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZNXMZ2Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZNXMZ2Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1115841,"name":"InPlace Shelving, 00191903, 23.6 Inches Wide x 8 Inches Deep x 1.5 Inches High, Driftwood InPlace Floating Shelf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YtwA-iOdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Organize your home and free countertops from clutter with this stylish shelf. This floating shelf with invisible floating shelf brackets has a beautiful driftwood color and finish. The shelf measures 23. 6\" wide x 8\" deep x 1. 5\" high, and has a load capacity of 17 lbs. These shelves are simple to install and all mounting hardware and instructions are included. They hang on walls with no visible screws, connectors, or tracks. These shelves pair beautifully with rustic, farmhouse, beach, or spa design themes. These floating shelves offer attractive storage space for laundry rooms, mud rooms, kitchens, and more! Buy two or three together to fill empty wall space and display functional items like dishes, pictures, candles, towels, laundry soap, kitchen items, or children's stuffed animals. This shelf will perfectly complement the wall decor in your home. Established in 1930, Hyman has been built on the principles of quality, service, and innovation. Known for marketing innovative home decor and building products for over 85 years, we provide a wide range of home accessories and improvement products for consumers, pros, and home decorators. Today, Lewis Hyman, and LH Licensed Products are jointly marketed as Hyman Our corporate headquarters in Carson, CA includes a 100, 000 square foot distribution facility. Our Atlanta, GA office largely supports our e-commerce business and continues to provide our “quick ship” program to the east coast and the southeastern United States. We currently have showrooms in both office locations to collaborate with our partners and customers from all over the world. Finally, we also offer our trade customers access to these same services from our offices in North Carolina, Portugal, Hong Kong, and Shanghai. Use your gift card and search our other amazing products at our storefront.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YtwA-iOdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"InPlace Shelving","source_asin":"B077P5Z6ND","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1115841","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077P5Z6ND","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077P5Z6ND","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
